tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.poster.avif?t=1772936158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.webm?t=1772936158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.mp4?t=1772936158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an &quot;Anti-Stress&quot; mechanic designed for players who are very afraid of playing horror games<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/c9b066dea9e48608961bf344a04cedb7.poster.avif?t=1772936158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/c9b066dea9e48608961bf344a04cedb7.webm?t=1772936158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/c9b066dea9e48608961bf344a04cedb7.mp4?t=1772936158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifelike сhat simulation. Donations provide hints or lead you astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.poster.avif?t=1772936158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.webm?t=1772936158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st